# A profile of deploy/deploy.sh on Kubernetes (PLAN 10.9): one node with
# four drives on the cluster's default StorageClass, S3 on a NodePort for one
# network, the admin port closed. make deploy-check renders it with the chart
# and validates the render (test/deploy, TestProfilesRender). Names and
# addresses are placeholders; no profile holds or names a secret.
# nodes: 1
DEPLOY_TARGET=k8s
K8S_CONTEXT=profile
KMS=local
K8S_S3_ALLOW_FROM=192.0.2.0/24
